PTX warpspeed-reader-side-proxy-fence+no-fence
"As warpspeed-reader-side-proxy-fence without the fence.proxy.async: the bulk copy reads smem through the async proxy, and nothing orders the generic store before it (8.6). Expected: allowed."
{
s=0 @cta 0;
g=9;
m=mbarrier(1) @cta 0;
P1:r0=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0      | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                         ;
 st.weak.shared::cta s, 1      | mbarrier.try_wait.parity.acquire.cta r0, m, 0    ;
 mbarrier.arrive.release.cta m | cp.async.bulk.global.shared::cta.bulk_group g, s ;
                               | cp.async.bulk.commit_group                       ;
                               | cp.async.bulk.wait_group.read 0                  ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ g == 0)
